@startuml UC45_SSD
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title UC45: System Sequence Diagram - Manage Concert Day Survival Checklist

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System : toggleChecklistItem(itemID, isChecked)
System --> User : animateProgressBar(progressPercent)
